// EXPECT: E0218 — a field a union does not have (ADR-0045 §5)
// A union's field access is a struct's, identically: the same lookup, the same diagnostic, and
// the same near-name suggestion. Only the offsets differ, and those are `jr-pool`'s. This file
// exists to prove the sharing rather than to test a new rule — a union that reported a
// *different* message here would mean the two paths had diverged.
Value :: union {
    signed: s64;
    unsigned: u64;
}

main :: () {
    v: Value;
    n := v.singed;
}
